    {
      "id": "identity-bounded-continuous-embedding-lemma",
      "type": "lemma",
      "regions": [
        [
          243,
          80,
          145,
          955,
          240
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Let $X$ and $Y$ be Banach spaces. Then $X$ is continuously imbedded in $Y$ if and only if the identity mapping from $X$ to $Y$ is well defined (i.e., $X\\subset Y$) and bounded.",
      "zh": "设 $X$ 和 $Y$ 为 Banach 空间. 那么 $X$ 连续嵌入 $Y$ 的充分必要条件是从 $X$ 到 $Y$ 的恒等映射有良好定义 (即 $X\\subset Y$) 且有界.",
      "label": "lem:identity-bounded-continuous-embedding",
      "render_role": "lemma",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 243,
          "printed_page": 233,
          "bbox": [
