      ],
      "en": "Corollary~\\ref{cor:sobolev-extension-continuity} implies that if $k>m/2$ and $\\Omega\\subset\\mathbb{R}^m$ has the $k$-extension property, then the identity mapping from $H^k(\\Omega)$ to $C_b(\\overline\\Omega)$ is bounded.",
