    {
      "id": "right-left-shifts-and-domain-dependent-inverses-example",
      "type": "example",
      "regions": [
        [
          243,
          80,
          710,
          955,
          1210
        ]
      ],
      "en": "For any $x=\\{x_1,x_2,\\ldots,x_n,\\ldots\\}\\in\\ell^2$ we define the \\textbf{right shift} operator $S_r:\\ell^2\\to\\ell^2$ by\\[S_r(x)=\\{0,x_1,x_2,\\ldots,x_n,\\ldots\\}.\\]The range is the set of all elements in $\\ell^2$ with first component $0$; i.e., $\\{1,0,0,\\ldots\\}^{\\perp}$. The nullspace is the singleton $\\{0\\}$. Since $\\|S_r(x)\\|=\\|x\\|$, we have $\\|S_r\\|=1$.\n\nWe define the \\textbf{left shift} operator $S_l:\\ell^2\\to\\ell^2$ by\\[S_l(x)=\\{x_2,\\ldots,x_n,\\ldots\\}.\\]The range of $S_l$ is $\\ell^2$ and its nullspace is spanned by the element $\\{1,0,0,\\ldots\\}$. Since $\\|S_l(x)\\|\\leq\\|x\\|$ and since $\\|S_l(x)\\|=\\|x\\|$ for any $x\\in\\{1,0,0,\\ldots\\}^{\\perp}$ we have $\\|S_l\\|=1$.\n\nClearly, $S_r$ is invertible and $S_r^{-1}=S_l$. If we take $\\mathcal{D}(S_l)=\\ell^2$, then $S_l$ is not invertible. (Its nullspace is nontrivial.) However, if we take $\\mathcal{D}(S_l):=\\{1,0,0,\\ldots\\}^{\\perp}$, then $S_l$ is invertible and $S_l^{-1}=S_r$.",
      "zh": "对任意 $x=\\{x_1,x_2,\\ldots,x_n,\\ldots\\}\\in\\ell^2$, 用下式定义\\textbf{右移}算子 $S_r:\\ell^2\\to\\ell^2$:\\[S_r(x)=\\{0,x_1,x_2,\\ldots,x_n,\\ldots\\}.\\]值域为 $\\ell^2$ 中第一分量为 $0$ 的所有元素的集合, 即 $\\{1,0,0,\\ldots\\}^{\\perp}$. 零空间为单点集 $\\{0\\}$. 由于 $\\|S_r(x)\\|=\\|x\\|$, 有 $\\|S_r\\|=1$.\n\n用下式定义\\textbf{左移}算子 $S_l:\\ell^2\\to\\ell^2$:\\[S_l(x)=\\{x_2,\\ldots,x_n,\\ldots\\}.\\]$S_l$ 的值域为 $\\ell^2$, 零空间由元素 $\\{1,0,0,\\ldots\\}$ 张成. 由于 $\\|S_l(x)\\|\\leq\\|x\\|$, 并且对任意 $x\\in\\{1,0,0,\\ldots\\}^{\\perp}$ 都有 $\\|S_l(x)\\|=\\|x\\|$, 所以 $\\|S_l\\|=1$.\n\n显然, $S_r$ 可逆, 且 $S_r^{-1}=S_l$. 若取 $\\mathcal{D}(S_l)=\\ell^2$, 则 $S_l$ 不可逆. (其零空间非平凡.) 然而, 若取 $\\mathcal{D}(S_l):=\\{1,0,0,\\ldots\\}^{\\perp}$, 则 $S_l$ 可逆, 且 $S_l^{-1}=S_r$.",
      "label": "ex:right-left-shifts-domain-dependent-inverses",
      "minimum_heading_lines": 4,
      "render_role": "example",
