          243,
          80,
          1225,
          955,
          1350
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Let $H$ be a Hilbert space and let $M\\subset H$ be a closed subspace. Then we define the \\textbf{orthogonal projection} operator $P_M:H\\to M$ so that for any $x\\in H$, $P_Mx$ is the unique element of $M$ such that $(x-P_Mx)\\in M^{\\perp}$.",
      "zh": "设 $H$ 为 Hilbert 空间, $M\\subset H$ 为闭子空间. 定义\\textbf{正交投影}算子 $P_M:H\\to M$, 使对任意 $x\\in H$, $P_Mx$ 为 $M$ 中满足 $(x-P_Mx)\\in M^{\\perp}$ 的唯一元素.",
      "label": "ex:orthogonal-projection-operator",
      "minimum_heading_lines": 4,
      "render_role": "example",
